;
; How Levin files one circuit of a home's panel tree in MYRA
; (levin_rules.h LR6): a sparse record under the panel and the circuit,
; with the circuit it is fed from (its parent, 0 for the panel's main
; switch), its breaker's rating and its cable's rating, both in mA. The
; model asks whether the numbers fit before it keeps the circuit.
^ZXLEVIN(panel:i2, circuit:i3) = parent:i3! ^ breaker:i6! ^ cable:i6!
